# Both drivers save before step 30 and restore before 60; end is logical step 59.
expect pos 0.002 rot 0.000122 vel 0.000122 horizon 90 counts exact
world gravity 0 0 0 dt 1 60 substeps 4 steps 90
body dynamic position 0 3 0 rotation 0 0 0 1 linvel 0.5 0 0 angvel 0 0 0 flags nosleep
shape 0 sphere 0.5 density 1 friction 0.5 restitution 0
snapshot save at 30
snapshot restore at 60
